sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuário (sk)
  participant R as Receiver
  participant M as Manager
  participant DB as SSOT (schema sum)
  participant P as Publisher
  participant REC as Reconciler
  participant OB as Observer
  participant EX as Executor
  participant Z as Zitadel
  U->>R: GET /v1/sum/services/{resourceId}
  R-->>U: 200 com resourceVersion
  U->>R: DELETE /v1/sum/services/{resourceId}?resourceVersion=N
  R->>R: valida o token, a role sum.ipm.disable e a posse da ligação
  R->>M: requested-delete (REQUESTED)
  R-->>U: 202 operationId
  alt resourceVersion diferente da atual
    M->>DB: Operation rejected (conflict), nada muda
  else ligação já desligada ou inexistente
    M->>DB: Operation rejected (not_found), nada muda
  else aceito
    M->>DB: lifecycle absent, geração + 1, serviceRoles vazio, outbox desired
    P->>REC: desired absent (DESIRED)
    REC->>EX: action update (roles ainda presentes)
    EX->>Z: remove só as roles do catálogo do serviço
    EX->>Z: remove a autorização se não sobra nenhuma role
    EX->>REC: completed (RESULT)
    OB->>Z: lê as roles
    OB->>M: observed sem roles
    M->>DB: fase Ready, Operation completed (a linha fica como histórico)
  end
